.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
src/**
# Webview stylesheets AND the vendored codicon font must ship — localResourceRoots
# is extensionUri/src/ui, so they load from source, not from dist/. Keep BOTH of
# these globs: the single styles.css was split into ten sheets (base, settings,
# picker, hljs, code-block, varset, form, codicon, main-view, main-pane), and a
# named exception would have silently shipped a CSS-less extension. The .ttf
# needs its own line because *.css does not match it — a missing font is the
# same silent failure one file type over, rendering the pane as tofu boxes with
# no error.
!src/ui/*.css
!src/ui/*.ttf
test/**
dist/test/**
.gitignore
.yarnrc
vsc-extension-quickstart.md
**/tsconfig.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.ts
**/.vscode-test.*
